01:13:07.375 --> 01:13:08.750
I'm sure that
you're going to get

01:13:08.750 --> 01:13:11.847
quite a few requests
for feature enhancements

01:13:11.847 --> 01:13:12.680
and stuff like that.

01:13:12.680 --> 01:13:16.160
And it's exciting that we
can take some of the feedback

01:13:16.160 --> 01:13:19.760
from the community and
start building it out

01:13:19.760 --> 01:13:21.060
into actual products and stuff.

01:13:21.060 --> 01:13:23.150
And that's pretty much
how BigQuery ML started.

01:13:23.150 --> 01:13:24.401
So that's really exciting.

01:13:24.401 --> 01:13:24.900
Cool.

01:13:24.900 --> 01:13:26.775
ABHISHEK KASHYAP: Yeah,
and what we have seen

01:13:26.775 --> 01:13:32.620
is, if you know SQL, whether
you use BigQuery or not,

01:13:32.620 --> 01:13:34.240
