01:13:34.240 --> 01:13:39.070
You can go to the platform, get
familiar within a few hours.

01:13:39.070 --> 01:13:40.970
And you can actually
write your first model

01:13:40.970 --> 01:13:42.280
within another two hours.

01:13:42.280 --> 01:13:43.330
NICK ORLOVE: Cool.

01:13:43.330 --> 01:13:45.010
ABHISHEK KASHYAP:
If you know it,

01:13:45.010 --> 01:13:47.010
it's 15 minutes to
write your first model.

01:13:47.010 --> 01:13:50.004
And even if you don't, you
