01:13:50.920 --> 01:13:53.260
And within an hour
or two, you'll

01:13:53.260 --> 01:13:54.950
have your first
machine learning model.

01:13:54.950 --> 01:13:55.325
NICK ORLOVE: Awesome.

01:13:55.325 --> 01:13:57.533
ABHISHEK KASHYAP: And that's
going to be so exciting.

