01:22:41.310 --> 01:22:44.210
And until next time, I
guess we'll see you later.

01:22:44.210 --> 01:22:44.710
Thank you.

01:22:44.710 --> 01:22:45.490
ABHISHEK KASHYAP:
It was a pleasure.

